      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHARLOTTES DIAMOND (9) raced in a handy position last start and stuck on well for third, beaten 2.7 metres. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Suited dropping back to maiden company and her recent form is good enough to take out a race like this. COMPLIMENTRY DRINK (8) broke last time but recorded a close second in stronger company here prior. Draws wide but should enjoy the drop back to a maiden. DREAM TO CURE (1) has had wide draws in the last two outings but came from this barrier to place three back at this circuit and distance. Should enjoy a cosy run and this looks a suitable assignment. FURYROCK (3) broke fresh but was better when fourth at his most recent appearance at this circuit and distance. Can progress further third-up.",
